  "white_box_conclusions": [
    "The common composition schema preserves every declared column and positive fraction; no clipping, silent conversion or renormalization is performed.",
    "Any unsupported positive constituent invalidates a whole-source row, including arbitrarily small positive inputs representable as floats.",
    "All unordered pairs remain in column-index order. Absent pairs use zero plus an activity mask; active unsupported pairs use NaN plus support metadata.",
    "Source vocabulary, supplied-source positive observation and supplied pair occurrence are distinct records; none is represented as a guarantee of physical applicability.",
    "The corrected pair evaluator uses the same fixed callable and modeled output scale for whole, pure and pair inputs.",
    "FrozenModel matches the original two-SiLU-trunk, latent-mean and head computation. Source preprocessing/latent scaling and property affine unstandardization use saved parameters.",
    "YVAE inference uses posterior mean deterministically; independent source/seed latent axes are not averaged.",
    "Property output preserves the modeled log/log1p scale where applicable; no implicit nonlinear inverse or head-after-boundary operation is introduced.",
    "FrozenBank pins the v49 schema, source-archive identity, catalogue/card order and source vocabulary; legacy polymer checkpoints remain outside this loader."
